00:36:12.070 --> 00:36:31.049
Richard Bair: Yes, yeah. So, yeah, exactly, so it just depends on what stage of the process it's at when this happens. So there is a companion hip to this one that will be coming that replaces the account ID on the transaction with node IDs, and that will solve a couple problems for us, this being one of them.

